  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-09-12</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">辦公室應用</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">developer-roadmap</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 367,002</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案提供互動式職涯路線圖、指南及教育內容，協助開發者規劃並成長。這是一個寶貴的職涯發展資源，讓開發者能系統性地學習新技能並提升專業能力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/nilbuild/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">itsgiving</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 787</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">itsgiving 是一個有趣且創新的應用程式，旨在透過迷因（memes）的方式，讓使用者在會議中表達自己。它為嚴肅的會議增添了趣味性，有助於活絡討論氛圍並促進團隊互動。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/gazijarin/itsgiving\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/itsgiving\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">Mac-Duo</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Swift | Star: 685</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Mac-Duo 旨在將 iPhone 上的「雙人模式」效果帶到 MacBook 上，提升多工處理或協作的視覺體驗。它為 macOS 用戶帶來獨特的界面功能，改善在筆記型電腦上的工作流。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/sumimakito/Mac-Duo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/辦公室應用/Mac-Duo\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">寫程式</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">public-apis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 479,408</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">該專案彙整了大量的免費 API 資源，涵蓋多種應用領域，為開發者提供便捷的介面查找與整合能力。它是一個極佳的開發者工具箱，加速專案的開發進程。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">freeCodeCamp</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 455,364</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">freeCodeCamp 提供開源程式碼和課程，讓使用者免費學習數學、程式設計與電腦科學。對於想入門或提升程式技能的人來說，這是一個非常全面且實用的線上學習平台。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">free-programming-books</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 396,631</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案匯集了大量可免費取得的程式設計書籍，涵蓋各種程式語言與技術領域。對於尋求學習資源的開發者和學生而言，這是一個寶貴的知識寶庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-selfhosted</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 318,815</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案彙整了大量可自行架設的免費網路服務與網頁應用程式。對於希望掌控數據、保護隱私或自行管理服務的技術使用者來說，這是一個極具價值的資源列表。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/awesome-selfhosted\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">project-based-learning</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n          <span style=\"background:#f97316; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px;\">🆕 版本更新</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 283,094</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案整理了豐富的專案式學習教學清單，鼓勵實作來提升程式設計技能。對於希望透過實際動手做來學習新技術或鞏固知識的學習者而言，這是一個非常實用的資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/practical-tutorials/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/project-based-learning\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">dlssg_for_sm86</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 2,173</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">這個專案為 RTX 30 系列 GPU 提供了 DLSSG（DLSS Frame Generation）解決方案。它可能允許這些顯卡享受類似新世代 GPU 的畫面生成技術，提升遊戲和應用程式的視覺流暢度。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/sdli1995/dlssg_for_sm86\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/dlssg_for_sm86\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">NavierStokesAndEuler</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Lean | Star: 1,823</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">此專案包含用於驗證 Navier-Stokes 方程式和 Euler 方程式結果的 Lean 證明。它在數學和計算物理領域具有重要意義，有助於確保複雜科學模型的正確性。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/NavierStokesAndEuler\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/NavierStokesAndEuler\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">bank-sampah</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: PHP | Star: 921</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">bank-sampah 是一個基於 PHP 的專案，儘管缺乏具體描述，但從名稱猜測可能與「垃圾銀行」或廢物管理系統有關。它可能旨在提供一個平台來管理回收物或促進環保活動。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Faizpi/bank-sampah\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/寫程式/bank-sampah\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Skill</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">holo-card-studio</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 1,467</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">holo-card-studio 能將使用者的描述或參考圖轉換為可編輯的 Blender 卡片和互動式 Three.js 網頁。它利用 AI 技術生成符合主題、風格和排版的 3D 視覺內容，為創意設計和網頁開發提供強大工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EverettFish/holo-card-studio\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/holo-card-studio\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">Edge0</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 1,445</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">Edge0 是一個與 AI 相關的專案，儘管缺乏具體描述，但其名稱暗示可能專注於邊緣 AI 或 AI 基礎設施。它可能提供用於部署和管理 AI 模型的工具或框架，值得進一步探索其潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Edge0-AI/Edge0\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/Edge0\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">anything2explainer</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 1,055</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">anything2explainer 是一個 Claude Code/Codex 技能，能將任何主題轉換為帶有旁白、字幕和章節進度條的動態圖形解說影片。它自動生成專業水準的教學內容，極大地提升了內容創作的效率和可達性。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Vincentwei1021/anything2explainer\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/anything2explainer\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">screenwriting-skills</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n          \n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 879</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">screenwriting-skills 是一個與劇本創作相關的 Python 專案，可能提供 AI 輔助編劇的功能或工具。它有望幫助編劇生成創意點子、優化劇情結構或自動化劇本草稿，提升創作效率。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jtydhr88/screenwriting-skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/AI Skill/screenwriting-skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">AI Agent</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; b